'''Pigge Back''' (豚戦わんこ ''Buta Sen Wanko'', '''Pig Against Doggy''') is a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemy that appears in [[Special Events|Event Stages]]. They were added in [[Version 2.7 Update|Version 2.7]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], they were added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Pigge Back
|image = E 111.png
|first appearance = [[Awkward Entrance]]
|latest appearance = [[Feast of Fall: Supreme (Merciless)]]
|money drop = 500¢ - 1,975¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy is a [[Pigge]] carried by three [[Doge]]s. The Pigge wears a white headband, while the Doges are wearing some sort of white clothing along with a visor. Its attack animation consists of the three Doges jumping up and preparing to bite, throwing Pigge up into the air. Pigge then lands on the Doges and they bite the target.

Fortunately, with only 10,000 health and 200 attack power when not buffed, this enemy is not very threatening, the only other thing it has going for it is its quick attack rate.

==Strategy==
This enemy can easily be killed by [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Axe Cat]], [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Fish Cat]], [[Swordsman Cat (Rare Cat)|Swordsman Cat]], [[Bath Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bath Cat]], [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Hip Hop Cat]], and numerous other [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red cats]].

