==Trivia==
*Pigge Back's name is a pun on "piggyback ride".
*Pigge Back was introduced in the second [[Autumn = Sports Day! (Monthly Event)|Autumn = Sports Day!]] event, instead of the first.
*Pigge Back was the last main Monthly Enemy to be implemented, even though it is listed first in the [[Enemy Guide]] and the event it appears in appeared first among all Monthly Events.
*Unlike its [[Sports Day Cat (Rare Cat)|cat counterpart]], this enemy is not an exact combination of 1 [[Pigge]] and 3 [[Doge]]s. If it was, it would have 1,770 HP and 144 DMG.
*Pigge Back was originally a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]]/[[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemy. This seems to have been changed some time after [[Version 5.10 Update|Version 5.10]].

